ind":"announcement","title":"New Deployment System, Keyboard Shortcuts, Compass & Continuous Alpha Testing","summary":"Today brings a major update to War Company, introducing a new deployment order system, keyboard shortcuts for issuing commands, and a new compass ribbon to improve map orientation.This update also marks an important step forward for the demo as it moves toward more active, ongoing playtesting. The goal is to gather continuous player feedback, iterate on new features, and keep improving the experience all the way up to release.Here’s what’s new!A New Compass Ribbon The first thing you’ll notice i","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-25T11:05:57Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114041686","verified_at":"2026-10-25T14:02:48Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4241390-1847286114037867","game_id":"steam-4241390","kind":"update","title":"Latest Update: Armor Crews and Order Control Changes","summary":"This update brings important changes, fully crewed tanks, and the first steps on control improvements.Order Controls — A New Way to Issue CommandsThe latest patch offers some flexibility in how orders are issued, giving you more control over how your units carry out their tasks.New orders replace existing orders by default. Issuing a new order will replace the unit's current order set unless you hold Shift.Hold Shift to queue orders. This allows you to append new orders to the existing order set","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-23T20:15:51Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114037867","verified_at":"2026-10-23T23:33:03Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4241390-1847286114034039","game_id":"steam-4241390","kind":"announcement","title":"PatchFest Updates!","summary":"I've been working hard to deliver new updates throughout NextFest! There's still a long road ahead, and many of the features suggested by players are yet to come. I'll be focusing heavily on development over the next few months to bring the game up to its full potential.Here's a summary of the changes made during NextFest so far, more likely to come: Small update to optimize the game and fix some potential startup issues:ChangelogMany audio assets are now lazy loaded to reduce startup time and m","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-22T20:02:20Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114034039","verified_at":"2026-10-22T20:28:28Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4241390-1846651706685401","game_id":"steam-4241390","kind":"update","title":"Environment Overhaul update for the Demo!","summary":"I've just pushed a major environment overhaul, updating almost all of the nature assets in the demo. While it's not aiming for AAA-level visuals, the goal is to create a more immersive atmosphere while still leaving a little room for imagination.Thank you all for the continued feedback and support! I'm paying close attention to what players are saying, and I'll do my best to prioritize the changes that align with the community's overall feedback.I'm also leaning toward delaying the full release ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-17T19:22:28Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706685401","verified_at":"2026-10-20T13:20:40Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4241390-1846651706680922","game_id":"steam-4241390","kind":"announcement","title":"Demo Updates!","summary":"Thanks to all the feedback and reports from the demo launch! I've been pushing updates quickly over the past couple days and wanted to document them for clarity. This biggest issue is that some users had Mouse control/DPI issues on Windows. The new build starts the game up in Fullscreen Windowed (borderless) mode to sidestep this issue. Hope to get feedback if this helps those with this issue. Here are the changes since initial launch ːsteamthisː Update to the War Company Demo pushed to Steam Ch","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-16T10:34:51Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706680922","verified_at":"2026-10-20T13:20:40Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4241390":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T01:50:00Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T01:49:59Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4241390":"2026-10-26T01:50:00Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4241390":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T01:49:59Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T01:49:59Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]},"5376340":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T01:50:00Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T01:50:00Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-4241390","app_id":4241390,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:14:30Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_item_sha256":"2ece11b3fa001e1663d60a36e999aafb2ccfff08843b27f0662ca2f081d402e3","response_sha256":null,"source_fields":{"basic_info":{"short_description":"역동적인 3D 캠페인에서 군대를 이끌고, 실시간으로 펼쳐지는 전투를 지휘하세요. 보급, 기동, 전술적 승리가 결합하여 전쟁의 운명을 결정짓습니다.","publishers":[{"name":"BROKE PROTOCOL","creator_clan_account_id":45887625}],"developers":[{"name":"BROKE PROTOCOL","creator_clan_account_id":45887625}]},"release":{"steam_